id: pm-fpdk37
title: "GH-1038: docs linked-resource pair syntax corrupts URLs and splits labeled entries"
description: The shared linked-document parser accepts advertised Markdown and CSV pair forms with exit zero while storing a corrupted URI or two unrelated document rows.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[8]: agent-ux,"area:sdk",context-integrity,docs,github-1038,linked-resources,parser,regression
created_at: "2026-08-16T05:10:46.721Z"
